{"model": "qwen3.8-max", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Inspect image 1 (RGB) to identify the requested object and destination. Image 2 is aligned depth for spatial context. Return only JSON. target_pixel and destination_pixel are [x,y] normalized integer coordinates 0 to 1000 (top-left 0,0, bottom-right 1000,1000). Select the visible object top center and destination interior. If uncertain use null points, skills [], reported_confidence 0. For a visible pick-and-place task skills must be exactly [\"HOME\",\"MOVE_ABOVE\",\"APPROACH\",\"GRASP\",\"LIFT\",\"MOVE_TO_REGION\",\"PLACE\",\"RELEASE\",\"RETREAT\",\"HOME\"]. target_label describes the object. reported_confidence is your uncertainty estimate. Schema: {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"target_pixel\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"maxItems\": 2, \"minItems\": 2, \"prefixItems\": [{\"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"type\": \"integer\"}], \"type\": \"array\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"title\": \"Target Pixel\"}, \"destination_pixel\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"maxItems\": 2, \"minItems\": 2, \"prefixItems\": [{\"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"type\": \"integer\"}], \"type\": \"array\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"title\": \"Destination Pixel\"}, \"target_label\": {\"maxLength\": 100, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Target Label\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"reported_confidence\": {\"maximum\": 1, \"minimum\": 0, \"title\": \"Reported Confidence\", \"type\": \"number\"}, \"skills\": {\"items\": {\"enum\": [\"HOME\", \"MOVE_ABOVE\", \"APPROACH\", \"GRASP\", \"LIFT\", \"MOVE_TO_REGION\", \"PLACE\", \"RELEASE\", \"RETREAT\"], \"type\": \"string\"}, \"maxItems\": 20, \"title\": \"Skills\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"reason\": {\"default\": \"\", \"maxLength\": 500, \"title\": \"Reason\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"target_pixel\", \"destination_pixel\", \"target_label\", \"reported_confidence\", \"skills\"], \"title\": \"VisualDecision\", \"type\": \"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "pick missing target"}, {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "data:image/png;base64,"}}, {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "data:image/png;base64,"}}]}], "temperature": 0.0, "max_tokens": 512, "response_format": {"type": "json_object"}, "enable_thinking": false}